Advancing the double of a preempt: game in a major with four cards and 10+,
3NT with 10+ and a stopper, otherwise the cheapest four-card suit (a major
first), and a pass with length in their suit.

(3C)-D-(P)-
4H = {prio:5} 10+ hcp, 4+!h
  #PASTE after-chain
4S = {prio:5} 10+ hcp, 4+!s
  #PASTE after-chain
3N = {prio:4} 10+ hcp, stopper
  #PASTE after-chain
3H = {prio:3} 0--9 hcp, 4+!h
  #PASTE after-chain
3S = {prio:3} 0--9 hcp, 4+!s
  #PASTE after-chain
3D = {prio:2} 0--9 hcp, 4+!d
  #PASTE after-chain
#PASTE pass-chain

